DO pick n2
EXPECT 0 0 "current output: n2"
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 n1@0.8,0.2 n2@0.5,0.8 n3@0.9,0.9 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 n2:2:1 n3:3:1 | L n0>n0:1 n0>n1:1 n1>n1:1 n1>n0:1 n2>n2:1 n3>n3:1 | D  | C n2 | S n2 | A 1
