DO undo
EXPECT 1 0 "undid place"
STATE N n0@0.1,0.1 n1@0.3,0.1 n2@0.5,0.1 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 n2:2:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 n2>n2:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO undo
EXPECT 1 0 "undid place"
STATE N n0@0.1,0.1 n1@0.3,0.1 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO undo
EXPECT 0 1 "nothing to undo"
STATE N n0@0.1,0.1 n1@0.3,0.1 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
ENDEDIT

# the fader layout. Changed ON PURPOSE in round 2: unused channels are slivers; bars narrow, and their gaps with them, to fit however many outputs; a label is the name if it fits, else the channel number, else nothing; a column at the right keeps the total on screen -- with thirty outputs it used to be drawn past the window's edge. Every bar's hit area takes in half the gap each side, for hover and click alike
EDIT chart_layout ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO place 0.2 0.2
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 | R  | O n0:0:1 | L n0>n0:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO place 0.8 0.2
EXPECT 1 0 ""
